 {
  "speaker": "阿信",
  "voice": "zh_male_m191_uranus_bigtts",
  "text": "先来看今天的特别报道。GPT-6正式发布，OpenAI宣称\"欢迎来到AGI时代\"。9月3日OpenAI正式发布新一代旗舰模型GPT-6（代号Astra），官方口号直指\"AGI时代\"，同日新版GPT Image 2.5已能以假乱真伪造GPT-6发布会画面，全球AI军备竞赛再度提速。",
  "dur": 25.149208333333334,
  "bg": "breaking.jpg",
  "video": "breaking_footage.mp4",
  "videoDur": 15.274,
  "isBreaking": true,
  "isInteractive": false,
  "cta": false,
  "data": [],
  "agenda": []
 },
 {
  "speaker": "小蓝",
  "voice": "zh_female_shuangkuaisisi_uranus_bigtts",
  "text": "发布当天自家服务先集体宕机，这个‘AGI时代’的开局也太黑色幽默了。",
  "dur": 5.90175,
  "bg": "breaking.jpg",
